a420b5e9171cdeb6704a35594baaf4/ss_fe67e165f7a420b5e9171cdeb6704a35594baaf4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761252808","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755550/fe67e165f7a420b5e9171cdeb6704a35594baaf4/ss_fe67e165f7a420b5e9171cdeb6704a35594baaf4.600x338.jpg?t=1761252808"}],"short_description":"Arm of the Prince is a turn-based tactical RPG with a strong narrative focus. Enjoy strategic combat unconstrained by grids, and experience a character-driven story filled with intrigue, oneiric revelations, and morally dubious paramilitary operations. The negotiations must fail.","steam_appid":3755550,"support_info":{"email":"BakarLabs@proton.me","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}